      "end_timestamp": "00:51",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yeah. Five days, I'd say. As for feeling dizzy when I stand, it feels severe to me. It sort of comes and goes. I get some relief from sitting down. Oh, and muscle cramps. That's been about the same, ten days.",
